Hello Everyone, I hope you are all doing well,

If you are receiving this email, then I have you down for Hosting here at H=
oneyman State Park for March of 2025.  I will be sending another email in a=
 few days that will go over the Orientation times for March and will also h=
ave a projected schedule attached.  If you have any questions about what si=
te you are headed to or if you need any host supplies such as a Sign, Namet=
ag or vest please contact me so I can get those ordered.   Hope to see you =
all soon for March!

[cid:image001.jpg@01DB7C99.60600E70]Logan Bliss | Volunteer Services Lead/R=
anger 1
